 .mw-parser-output .infobox-table{display:table!important}body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table>caption{display:table-caption!important}body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table>tbody{display:table-row-group}body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table th,body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table td{padding-left:inherit;padding-right:inherit}}</style><table class=\"infobox width: 25em; vevent haudio\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-above summary album\" style=\"font-style: italic; color: inherit; background-color: lightsteelblue; font-size: 125%;\">Black Orchid</th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Black_Orchid_(album).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/2/24/Black_Orchid_%28album%29.jpg/250px-Black_Orchid_%28album%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"248\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/2/24/Black_Orchid_%28album%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x\" data-file-width=\"317\" data-file-height=\"315\" /></a></span></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-header description\" style=\"color: #202122;background-color: lightsteelblue\"><a href=\"/wiki/Album\" title=\"Album\">Studio album</a>&#32;by <div class=\"contributor\" style=\"display:inline\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Three_Sounds\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Three Sounds\">The Three Sounds</a></div></th></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Released</th><td class=\"infobox-data published\">April 1964<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Recorded</th><td class=\"infobox-data plainlist\">February 4, 1962 (#10, 12–13, 15)<br />March 7, 1962 (#1–4 &amp; 6)<br />March 8, 1962 (#5, 7–8)<br />June 27, 1962 (#9, 11)</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Studios</th><td class=\"infobox-data plainlist\"><a href=\"/wiki/Van_Gelder_Studio\" title=\"Van Gelder Studio\">Van Gelder Studio</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Englewood_Cliffs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Englewood Cliffs\">Englewood Cliffs</a>, NJ</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Genre</th><td class=\"infobox-data category hlist\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jazz\" title=\"Jazz\">Jazz</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Length</th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><span class=\"duration\"><span class=\"min\">42</span>:<span class=\"s\">37</span></span> <small>original LP</small><br />74:02 <small>1998 CD reissue</small><br />69:53 <small>2015 CD reissue</small></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Labels</th><td class=\"infobox-data hlist\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blue_Note_Records\" title=\"Blue Note Records\">Blue Note</a><br /><small>BST 84155</small></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Producer</th><td class=\"infobox-data hlist\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alfred_Lion\" title=\"Alfred Lion\">Alfred Lion</a></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-header description\" style=\"color: #202122;background-color: lightsteelblue\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Three_Sounds\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Three Sounds\">The Three Sounds</a> chronology</th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" style=\"color:inherit; background: transparent; width: 100%; min-width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; display: inline-table;\">\n\n<tbody><tr style=\"line-height: 1.4em;\">\n<td style=\"width: 33%; text-align: center; vertical-align: top; padding: .2em .1em .2em 0\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Out_of_This_World_(The_Three_Sounds_album)\" title=\"Out of This World (The Three Sounds album)\">Out of This World</a></i><br />(1962)\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 33%; text-align: center; vertical-align: top; padding: .2em .1em\"><i><b>Black Orchid</b></i><br />(1964)\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 33%; text-align: center; vertical-align: top; padding: .2em 0 .2em .1em\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Standards_(The_Three_Sounds_album)\" title=\"Standards (The Three Sounds album)\">Standards</a></i><br />(1959/62)\n</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><i><b>Black Orchid</b></i> is an album by jazz group <a href=\"/wiki/The_Three_Sounds\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Three Sounds\">The Three Sounds</a> featuring performances recorded in 1962 and released on the <a href=\"/wiki/Blue_Note_Records\" title=\"Blue Note Records\">Blue Note</a> label.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Blue&#95;Note&#95;discography&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Blue_Note_discography-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> The 1998 limited CD reissue features another seven unissued tracks recorded at different sessions. It was also issued in Japan in 2015, on SHM-CD, featuring different bonus tracks recorded at the same sessions.\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Reception\">Reception</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Black_Orchid_(album)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Reception\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/Allmusic\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Allmusic\">Allmusic</a> review by Stephen Thomas Erlewine awarded the album 4 stars, stating \"It displays their knack for deftly swinging uptempo numbers, light blues and sensitive standards. If anything, it swings a little harder and is a little more soulful than some of its predecessors\".<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Allmusic&#95;3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Allmusic-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable floatright\" style=\"width:24.2em;font-size:88%;text-align:center;margin:0.5em 0 0.5em 1em;padding:0;border-spacing:0\"><caption style=\"font-size:115%\">Professional ratings</caption><tbody><tr><th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;color:#202122;background:#d1dbdf;font-size:100%\">Review scores</th></tr><tr><th scope=\"col\">Source</th><th scope=\"col\">Rating</th></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:middle\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Allmusic\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Allmusic\">Allmusic</a></i></td><td style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:middle\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\" title=\"4/5 stars\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"4/5 stars\"><img alt=\"Star\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/20px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/40px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"108\" data-file-height=\"110\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Star\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/20px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/40px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"108\" data-file-height=\"110\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Star\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/20px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/40px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"108\" data-file-height=\"110\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Star\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/20px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/40px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"108\" data-file-height=\"110\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Star_empty.svg/20px-Star_empty.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Star_empty.svg/40px-Star_empty.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"108\" data-file-height=\"110\" /></span></span></span><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Allmusic&#95;3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Allmusic-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:middle\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Penguin_Guide_to_Jazz_Recordings\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Penguin Guide to Jazz Recordings\">The Penguin Guide to Jazz Recordings</a></i></td><td style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:middle\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\" title=\"3/4 stars\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"3/4 stars\"><img alt=\"Star\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/20px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/40px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"108\" data-file-height=\"110\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Star\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/20px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/40px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"108\" data-file-height=\"110\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Star\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/20px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/40px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"108\" data-file-height=\"110\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Star_empty.svg/20px-Star_empty.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Star_empty.svg/40px-Star_empty.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"108\" data-file-height=\"110\" /></span></span></span><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Penguin&#95;4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Penguin-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Track_listing\">Track listing</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Black_Orchid_(album)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Track listing\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>All compositions by Gene Harris except as noted\n</p>\n<ol><li>\"Black Orchid\" (<a href=\"/wiki/Cal_Tjader\" title=\"Cal Tjader\">Cal Tjader</a>) - Erroneously credited to (<a href=\"/wiki/Neal_Hefti\" title=\"Neal Hefti\">Neal Hefti</a>) - 5:25</li>\n<li>\"<a href=\"/wiki/A_Foggy_Day\" title=\"A Foggy Day\">A Foggy Day</a>\" (<a href=\"/wiki/George_Gershwin\" title=\"George Gershwin\">Gershwin</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ira_Gershwin\" title=\"Ira Gershwin\">Gershwin</a>) -  6:46</li>\n<li>\"<a href=\"/wiki/For_All_We_Know_(1934_song)\" title=\"For All We Know (1934 song)\">For All We Know</a>\" (<a href=\"/wiki/J._Fred_Coots\" title=\"J. Fred Coots\">Coots</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sam_M._Lewis\" title=\"Sam M. Lewis\">Lewis</a>) - 5:31</li>\n<li>\"Oh Well, Oh Well\" - 3:45</li>\n<li>\"<a href=\"/wiki/At_Last\" title=\"At Last\">At Last</a>\" (<a href=\"/wiki/Mack_Gordon\" title=\"Mack Gordon\">Gordon</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Harry_Warren\" title=\"Harry Warren\">Warren</a>) - 5:37</li>\n<li>\"<a href=\"/wiki/Secret_Love_(1953_song)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Secret Love (1953 song)\">Secret Love</a>\" (<a href=\"/wiki/Sammy_Fain\" title=\"Sammy Fain\">Sammy Fain</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Paul_Francis_Webster\" title=\"Paul Francis Webster\">Paul Francis Webster</a>) - 5:44</li>\n<li>\"Don't Go, Don't Go\" - 5:08</li>\n<li>\"Saucer Eyes\" (<a href=\"/wiki/Randy_Weston\" title=\"Randy Weston\">Weston</a>) - 4:41</li></ol>\n<p><small><b>Bonus tracks on 1998 CD reissue:</b></small>\n</p>\n<ol><li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li><li value=\"9\">\"You Dig It\" - 5:41</li>\n<li>\"<a href=\"/wiki/Nature_Boy\" title=\"Nature Boy\">Nature Boy</a>\" (<a href=\"/wiki/Eden_ahbez\" title=\"Eden ahbez\">eden ahbez</a>) - 4:11</li>\n<li>\"Theme From M Squad\" (Count Basie) - erroneously credited to (<a href=\"/wiki/Benny_Carter\" title=\"Benny Carter\">Carter</a>) - 4:15</li>\n<li>\"Azule Serape\" (<a href=\"/wiki/Victor_Feldman\" title=\"Victor Feldman\">Feldman</a>) - 4:22</li>\n<li>\"For Dancers Only\" (<a href=\"/wiki/Sy_Oliver\" title=\"Sy Oliver\">Oliver</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Don_Raye\" title=\"Don Raye\">Raye</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Vic_Schoen\" title=\"Vic Schoen\">Schoen</a>) - 3:52</li>\n<li>\"Back Home\" - 3:27</li>\n<li>\"Tadd's Delight\" (<a href=\"/wiki/Tadd_Dameron\" title=\"Tadd Dameron\">Dameron</a>) - 5:37</li></ol>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"2015_SHM-CD_reissue\">2015 SHM-CD reissue</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Black_Orchid_(album)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: 2015 SHM-CD reissue\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ol><li>\"Black Orchid\" (<a href=\"/wiki/Cal_Tjader\" title=\"Cal Tjader\">Cal Tjader</a>) - Erroneously credited to (<a href=\"/wiki/Neil_Hefti\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Neil Hefti\">Neil Hefti</a>) - 5:24</li>\n<li>\"<a href=\"/wiki/A_Foggy_Day\" title=\"A Foggy Day\">A Foggy Day</a>\" (<a href=\"/wiki/George_Gershwin\" title=\"George Gershwin\">Gershwin</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ira_Gershwin\" title=\"Ira Gershwin\">Gershwin</a>) -  6:44</li>\n<li>\"<a href=\"/wiki/For_All_We_Know_(1934_song)\" title=\"For All We Know (1934 song)\">For All We Know</a>\" (<a href=\"/wiki/J._Fred_Coots\" title=\"J. Fred Coots\">Coots</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sam_M._Lewis\" title=\"Sam M. Lewis\">Lewis</a>) - 5:29</li>\n<li>\"Oh Well, Oh Well\" - 3:43</li>\n<li>\"<a href=\"/wiki/At_Last\" title=\"At Last\">At Last</a>\" (<a href=\"/wiki/Mack_Gordon\" title=\"Mack Gordon\">Gordon</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Harry_Warren\" title=\"Harry Warren\">Warren</a>) - 5:34</li>\n<li>\"<a href=\"/wiki/Secret_Love_(1953_song)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Secret Love (1953 song)\">Secret Love</a>\" (<a href=\"/wiki/Sammy_Fain\" title=\"Sammy Fain\">Fain</a>) - 5:42</li>\n<li>\"Don't Go, Don't Go\" - 5:05</li>\n<li>\"Saucer Eyes\" (<a href=\"/wiki/Randy_Weston\" title=\"Randy Weston\">Weston</a>) - 4:40</li></ol>\n<p><small><b>Bonus tracks</b></small>\n</p>\n<ol><li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li><li value=\"9\">\"Babe's Blues\" (<a href=\"/wiki/Randy_Weston\" title=\"Randy Weston\">Randy Weston</a>) - 4:37</li>\n<li>\"Over the Rainbow\" (Harburg, Arlen) - 4:55</li>\n<li>\"Tadd's Delight\" (<a href=\"/wiki/Tadd_Dameron\" title=\"Tadd Dameron\">Dameron</a>) - 5:40</li>\n<li>\"Azule Serape\" (<a href=\"/wiki/Victor_Feldman\" title=\"Victor Feldman\">Feldman</a>) - 4:20</li>\n<li>\"For Dancers Only\" (<a href=\"/wiki/Sy_Oliver\" title=\"Sy Oliver\">Oliver</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Don_Raye\" title=\"Don Raye\">Raye</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Vic_Schoen\" title=\"Vic Schoen\">Schoen</a>) - 3:51</li>\n<li>\"<a href=\"/wiki/Nature_Boy\" title=\"Nature Boy\">Nature Boy</a>\" (<a href=\"/wiki/Eden_Ahbez\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Eden Ahbez\">Ahbez</a>) - 4:09</li></ol>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=